      "embedding": null,
      "metadata": {
        "source": "faq.md",
        "title": "用户反馈\"登录状态老是掉\"",
        "source_sha256": "05e6ac57128599f368789c9e0753ce164da08546a3913e6e942198207e26ced7",
        "content_sha256": "15acde013b75d03060968c169f98117d100eeaa18bd0fae67344b95784854ebd",
        "version": "ed19a6eab97f53fb"
      },
      "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [
        "source",
        "title",
        "source_sha256",
        "content_sha256",
        "version"
      ],
      "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [
        "source",
        "title",
        "source_sha256",
        "content_sha256",
        "version"
      ],
      "relationships": {},
      "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}",
      "metadata_separator": "\n",
      "text": "1. 先确认会话有效期配置是否被改过，默认 20 分钟。\n2. 再看是不是恰好卡在到期时刻被判定为无效，检查边界用例。\n3. 最后确认前端是否在响应里正确保存了新的令牌。",
      "mimetype": "text/plain",
      "start_char_idx": null,
      "end_char_idx": null,
      "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}",
      "class_name": "TextNode"
    },
    {
