    {
      "id_": "f91b21fba8fe5d1fc41a1a8012ad73abcfca45b3bf87dbeba780c4b5710103e3",
      "embedding": null,
      "metadata": {
        "source": "session-rules.md",
        "title": "有效期长度",
        "source_sha256": "b7870a70d167516fa18d9e7083465d63b94c5bd10a5b0bd18134b94ae5a32051",
        "content_sha256": "d22aa6d0fa52c66821c8ea92146c1369c5f87d2e2fe2636512c8dfedd3bddfbc",
        "version": "ed19a6eab97f53fb"
      },
      "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [
        "source",
        "title",
        "source_sha256",
        "content_sha256",
        "version"
      ],
      "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [
        "source",
        "title",
        "source_sha256",
        "content_sha256",
        "version"
      ],
      "relationships": {},
      "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}",
      "metadata_separator": "\n",
      "text": "- 管理后台的登录会话有效期为 20 分钟。\n- 计时方式：从签发时刻开始计算，20 分钟后到期。\n- 空闲会话不自动续期，必须由用户请求触发刷新。",
      "mimetype": "text/plain",
      "start_char_idx": null,
      "end_char_idx": null,
      "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}",
      "class_name": "TextNode"
    },
    {
      "id_": "d195265d374acacdf26810410230418bf5a6fc60fcc8e38fd4f725ca8f1c5247",
      "embedding": null,
      "metadata": {
        "source": "session-rules.md",
        "title": "到期边界",
        "source_sha256": "b7870a70d167516fa18d9e7083465d63b94c5bd10a5b0bd18134b94ae5a32051",
        "content_sha256": "a855675004b075a717959e163d3317330f8df439d86188b9c3229bcea27b6b14",
        "version": "ed19a6eab97f53fb"
      },
      "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [
        "source",
        "title",
        "source_sha256",
        "content_sha256",
        "version"
      ],
      "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [
        "source",
        "title",
        "source_sha256",
        "content_sha256",
        "version"
      ],
      "relationships": {},
      "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}",
      "metadata_separator": "\n",
      "text": "- 项目约定：当前时刻恰好等于到期时刻时，会话必须判定为无效。\n- 也就是说，`now == expires_at` 属于已过期。\n- 实现上有效条件写作 `now < expires_at`，不要写成 `now <= expires_at`。",
      "mimetype": "text/plain",
      "start_char_idx": null,
      "end_char_idx": null,
      "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}",
      "class_name": "TextNode"
    },
    {
      "id_": "e7c9a1c3fec34aa1cfe0d4fb057907ebaec1d1b947c8dca3cd1ca89cf448ef73",
      "embedding": null,
      "metadata": {
        "source": "session-rules.md",
        "title": "续期",
        "source_sha256": "b7870a70d167516fa18d9e7083465d63b94c5bd10a5b0bd18134b94ae5a32051",
        "content_sha256": "abf81220a44000e0bf868527162432c0e01a651b280ef1bef4bdcfaffd5cf949",
        "version": "ed19a6eab97f53fb"
      },
      "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [
        "source",
        "title",
        "source_sha256",
        "content_sha256",
        "version"
      ],
      "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [
